  "body": "With five bedrooms, four bathrooms and two separate living areas, this substantial Millwater home gives everyone room to feel at home. Positioned on an approximately 793sqm section, the two-level residence offers around 253sqm of living space, complemented by a generous backyard and inviting outdoor entertaining areas.\r\n\r\nThe open-plan kitchen, dining and living area brings the household together, with a walk-in pantry providing practical storage. A second lounge offers flexibility for family activities, entertaining guests or enjoying a quiet retreat. Step onto the balcony for fresh air and a moment to unwind.\r\n\r\nTwo of the five bedrooms have their own ensuites, providing privacy and convenience for family members or visitors. Four heat pumps and underfloor heating in the bathrooms add comfort throughout the seasons, while the double internal-access garage makes every day coming and going easy.\r\n\r\nOutside, the beautiful kwila deck is ready for summer barbecues and relaxed gatherings. The expansive backyard gives children room to play and is also ideal for families with pets.\r\n\r\nFeatures you'll appreciate:\r\n* Approximately 793sqm section and 253sqm floor area\r\n* Five bedrooms and four bathrooms, including two ensuites\r\n* Two separate living areas\r\n* Modern kitchen with a walk-in pantry\r\n* Balcony and kwila deck\r\n* Generous backyard with potential for a swimming pool\r\n* Four heat pumps and bathroom underfloor heating\r\n* Double internal-access garage\r\n* Balance of a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee\r\n\r\nSchools, Silverdale Shopping Centre, cafés, motorway access and Orewa Beach are all within easy reach, making this a convenient base for family life.\r\nContact Linda Ke today for more information or to arrange a viewing.",
